abstract: >-
  High-school research demo: in-browser ResNet-18 U-Net lesion segmentation on
  BUSI with external BUS-BRA / BrEaST validation. Not for clinical use.
  Project by Surabhi Fadnavis. The code, analysis, text, and video were produced
  with AI tools (Cursor).
